---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="关于 · junnhwan"
  description="About junnhwan - CS student at Shenzhen University, full-stack & AI agent developer in the making."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 space-y-10">
    <!-- Profile Main Card -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl glass-card border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/80 shadow-2xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-6">
      <div class="relative w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-white/15 shadow-xl flex-shrink-0 bg-slate-900">
        <img
          src="/avatar.png"
          alt="junnhwan avatar"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          loading="eager"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3 text-center sm:text-left flex-1 min-w-0">
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2.5">
            <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white font-sans">
              hwan
            </h1>
            <span class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-400">@junnhwan</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">
              Open to Internships
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyan-400 font-medium mt-1">
            Full-stack & AI Agent developer in the making.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-1 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2 text-slate-400">
            <span>🎓</span>
            <span>深圳大学 · 计算机科学系（2028 届 / 本科在读）</span>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2 text-slate-400">
            <span>📍</span>
            <span>中国 · 广东深圳 (Shenzhen, China)</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Social & Contact Pills -->
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2.5">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/junnhwan"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-slate-200 hover:text-white text-xs font-mono border border-white/10 transition-colors"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"></path>
              <path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>GitHub</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="mailto:3373484735@qq.com"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-slate-200 hover:text-white text-xs font-mono border border-white/10 transition-colors"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect>
              <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>3373484735@qq.com</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/blog"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-cyan-400 hover:underline"
          >
            <span>浏览所有文章 →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section: About Me / Intro -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
          关于我 / About Me
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/70 border border-white/5 space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          👋 Hi there！我是 <strong>Junnhwan</strong>，目前就读于<strong>深圳大学计算机科学系</strong>（2028 届本科）。
        </p>
        <p>
          平时主要专注于 <strong>Go / Java 后端开发</strong> 与高并发系统实践，同时深入学习 <strong>AI Agent 架构机制与 RAG 落地</strong>。热衷于通过动手编码解决实际工程问题，探索大模型与基础设施的结合点。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-400">
          目前积极寻求后端开发、全栈或 AI Agent 方向的日常/暑期实习机会。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section: Languages & Tech Focus -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
          技术与工具 / Languages & Tech
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/60 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono">
            <span>🛠 编程语言 / Languages</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            {['Go (Golang)', 'Java', 'Python', 'TypeScript', 'SQL'].map((item) => (
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono text-cyan-300 bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20">
                {item}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/60 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono">
            <span>🚀 关注与探索 / Focus Areas</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            {['AI Agent 架构', 'RAG 检索增强', '高并发系统', '微服务', '云原生'].map((item) => (
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono text-slate-200 bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                {item}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sm:col-span-2 p-4 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/60 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono">
            <span>📦 后端框架与基础设施 / Frameworks & Infra</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            {['Gin', 'Spring Boot', 'MySQL', 'Redis', 'RabbitMQ', 'Kafka', 'Docker', 'Linux', 'Git'].map((item) => (
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
                {item}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section: Open Source Contributions -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
          开源贡献 / Open Source
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/70 border border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/k8sgpt-ai/k8sgpt"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-cyan-300 hover:underline font-mono"
              >
                k8sgpt-ai / k8sgpt
              </a>
              <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Contributor</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Giving Kubernetes Superpowers to everyone · 为 K8s 诊断分析器提供贡献与修复
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/70 border border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/kubevela/kubevela"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-cyan-300 hover:underline font-mono"
              >
                kubevela / kubevela
              </a>
              <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Contributor</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              The Modern Application Platform · 云原生多环境应用交付平台
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/70 border border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/k0sproject/k0smotron"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-cyan-300 hover:underline font-mono"
              >
                k0sproject / k0smotron
              </a>
              <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Contributor</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Kubernetes in Kubernetes · 在已有 K8s 集群中托管子控制面
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section: Selected Work / 核心实践 -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
          核心实践项目 / Projects
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <!-- Project 1: vid-lens -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/80 border border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-mono">vid-lens</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20">
                Go / RAG
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              面向长视频内容理解的 RAG 知识库问答平台。实现长音视频切片处理、ASR 语音转写、向量语义索引与多轮检索问答。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500">
            <span>● Go</span>
            <span>● RAG</span>
            <span>● LLM</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 2: video-feed -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/80 border border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-mono">video-feed</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20">
                Go / Backend
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              基于 Go/Gin 的短视频 Feed 流系统。支持账号鉴权、视频发布、游标分页、Redis 热榜缓存、RabbitMQ 异步 Worker、互动私信与分片断点续传。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500">
            <span>● Go / Gin</span>
            <span>● Redis</span>
            <span>● RabbitMQ</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section: Contact / Connect -->
    <section class="p-6 rounded-3xl glass-card bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950/90 to-slate-900/90 border border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">期待与您的交流与合作</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">欢迎邮件交流技术、面试讨论或实习机会投递</p>
      </div>

      <a
        href="mailto:3373484735@qq.com"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/20 hover:bg-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono font-medium border border-cyan-500/30 transition-all flex-shrink-0"
      >
        <span>发送邮件 / 3373484735@qq.com</span>
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
